Grab me one of them bad boys.

2096
01:28:55,121 --> 01:28:56,790
Sailor Moon thing
there, yeah, okay.

2097
01:28:56,790 --> 01:28:58,458
Dear Japan, maybe it's just
me and the rest of the world,

2098
01:28:58,458 --> 01:29:01,628
