stomachs is not a sport.

2099
01:29:01,628 --> 01:29:03,380
Hey, food for thought
at the very least.

2100
01:29:03,380 --> 01:29:04,881
You know Crow, you
don't have to take it out

2101
01:29:04,881 --> 01:29:06,591
on the whole country just
'cause you had to sit through

2102
01:29:06,591 --> 01:29:07,884
