every day that you're not Japan.

2109
01:29:22,232 --> 01:29:23,149
Crow, now.

2110
01:29:23,149 --> 01:29:24,359
Hey, are you Luxembourg?

2111
01:29:24,359 --> 01:29:25,068
No.

2112
01:29:25,068 --> 01:29:26,528
Then shut up!

2113
01:29:26,528 --> 01:29:31,241
Anyway, Luxembourg.

2114
01:29:31,241 --> 01:29:32,951
Well, who should I
make this out to, then?

2115
01:29:32,951 --> 01:29:33,535
Octavia.

2116
01:29:33,535 --> 01:29:34,744
Okay.

2117
01:29:34,744 --> 01:29:35,495
