2118
01:29:35,495 --> 01:29:36,788
Oh really?

2119
01:29:36,788 --> 01:29:41,626
To Octavia, happy
birthday, love, Mad Goth.

2120
01:29:41,626 --> 01:29:42,877
There you go.

2121
01:29:42,877 --> 01:29:45,130
Thank you, Mad Goth.

2122
01:29:45,130 --> 01:29:47,007
Okay Mike, dig this.

2123
01:29:47,007 --> 01:29:49,134
We're gonna grab Bobo
and get out of here,

2124
01:29:49,134 --> 01:29:52,554
if we don't have to wait
too damn much longer

2125
01:29:52,554 --> 01:29:53,972
