2128
01:29:57,475 --> 01:30:00,562
Ah, Julius, bet you could
take on a couple lions, huh?

2129
01:30:00,562 --> 01:30:02,355
Let's see what you got there.

2130
01:30:02,355 --> 01:30:06,610
Whoa, oh boy, hey everybody,
Julius is the new champion.

2131
01:30:06,610 --> 01:30:13,783
To Julius, go easy on the
lion, Mad Goth, there you go.

2132
01:30:13,783 --> 01:30:16,369
Well hello, fine foxy lady.

2133
01:30:16,369 --> 01:30:18,204
Yeah, listen Bobo,
here's the thing--

2134
01:30:18,204 --> 01:30:20,707
I'm gonna write down
a room number here.

2135
01:30:20,707 --> 01:30:23,043
Okay Bobo, I'm gonna
tell you something,

2136
01:30:23,043 --> 01:30:25,920
and then I'm gonna puke,
maybe not in that order.

2137
01:30:25,920 --> 01:30:29,215
To the blonde what's
got it going on.

2138
01:30:29,215 --> 01:30:31,176
(smashes)

2139
01:30:31,176 --> 01:30:36,681
Lawgiver, hello!
Hi, Brain Guy.

2140
01:30:36,681 --> 01:30:39,392
They are not gods.

2141
01:30:39,392 --> 01:30:41,436
Them, gods?

2142
01:30:41,436 --> 01:30:43,730
You gotta be kidding me.

2143
01:30:43,730 --> 01:30:47,734
They're no gods and I sure
as hell am no Mad Goth.

2144
01:30:47,734 --> 01:30:53,823
Guards, seize them.

2145
01:30:53,823 --> 01:30:54,658
("MST3K Love Theme" plays)

2146
